   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Harsh flash colour: median ~71, warm red shadows (44,28,25), warm highlights (225,210,199), red 57% of colour mass (the most red-dominant look), vivid skin (sat 0.42), saturation 0.43. Best for: Direct-flash candids, loud outfits and jewellery, crowds and parties, humorous documentary, night flash on the street. Strong - use at 60-80% on quieter frames.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
